msgid "Continue"
msgstr ""

#: files/parchaos-welcome:126
msgid ""
"A few quick choices and you're set. You can change any of them later in "
"ParchaOS Settings."
msgstr ""

#: files/parchaos-welcome:132
msgid "Pick a Style"
msgstr ""

#: files/parchaos-welcome:133
msgid "How the menu bar, dock, launcher and Parcha Controls look."
msgstr ""

#: files/parchaos-welcome:134
msgid "Style"
msgstr ""

#: files/parchaos-welcome:135
msgid "Glass"
msgstr ""

#: files/parchaos-welcome:135
msgid "Translucent, softly blurred surfaces with rounded shapes."
msgstr ""

#: files/parchaos-welcome:136
msgid "Classic"
msgstr ""

#: files/parchaos-welcome:136
msgid "Calmer frosted surfaces, more opaque, with tighter corners."
msgstr ""

#: files/parchaos-welcome:142
msgid "Light or Dark"
msgstr ""

#: files/parchaos-welcome:143
msgid "Switch any time from Parcha Controls in the top-right corner."
msgstr ""

#: files/parchaos-welcome:144
msgid "Appearance"
msgstr ""

#: files/parchaos-welcome:145
msgid "Light"
msgstr ""

#: files/parchaos-welcome:145
msgid "Bright windows and panels."
msgstr ""

#: files/parchaos-welcome:146
msgid "Dark"
msgstr ""

#: files/parchaos-welcome:146
msgid "Dark windows and panels, easier on the eyes at night."
msgstr ""

#: files/parchaos-welcome:153
msgid "The Super Key"
msgstr ""

#: files/parchaos-welcome:154
msgid "Choose which key your app shortcuts use."
msgstr ""

#: files/parchaos-welcome:155
msgid "Shortcuts"
msgstr ""

#: files/parchaos-welcome:156
msgid "Super for app shortcuts"
msgstr ""

#: files/parchaos-welcome:157
msgid ""
"Super+C copies, Super+V pastes, Super+Q quits. Ctrl stays free in the "
"terminal."
msgstr ""

#: files/parchaos-welcome:158
msgid "Ctrl for app shortcuts"
msgstr ""

#: files/parchaos-welcome:159
msgid "Ctrl+C copies and Ctrl+V pastes; Super opens system features."
msgstr ""

#: files/parchaos-welcome:166
msgid "Location Services"
msgstr ""

#: files/parchaos-welcome:167
msgid ""
"Lets the menu bar show the weather where you are, and apps like Maps and "
"Weather find you. To find your approximate location, the identifiers of "
"nearby Wi-Fi networks are sent to BeaconDB, and your IP address may be used."
msgstr ""

#: files/parchaos-welcome:174
msgid "Location"
msgstr ""

#: files/parchaos-welcome:175
msgid ""
"Off unless you turn it on. You can change this later in Settings, under "
"Privacy."
msgstr ""

#: files/parchaos-welcome:180
msgid "Launcher"
msgstr ""

#: files/parchaos-welcome:180
msgid ""
"Every app, from the dock's last button or Super+A. Drag icons to arrange "
"them; hold one over another to make a folder."
msgstr ""

#: files/parchaos-welcome:182
msgid "Parcha Controls"
msgstr ""

#: files/parchaos-welcome:182
msgid ""
"Wi-Fi, Bluetooth, Focus, Dark Mode, brightness and sound, from the top-right "
"corner."
msgstr ""

#: files/parchaos-welcome:184
msgid "Menu bar"
msgstr ""

#: files/parchaos-welcome:184
msgid ""
"The menus of the app you're using, always at the top. The passion fruit "
"holds About, Settings, Lock and Log Out."
msgstr ""

#: files/parchaos-welcome:186
msgid "Pick up where you left off"
msgstr ""

#: files/parchaos-welcome:186
msgid "Apps you had open come back when you log in again."
msgstr ""

#. Ticket #161: a place for passwords without a third-party app.
#: files/parchaos-welcome:189
msgid "Parcha Keys"
msgstr ""

#: files/parchaos-welcome:189
msgid ""
"Your saved passwords and keys, the ones apps and the browser keep for you, "
"in the launcher under Parcha Keys."
msgstr ""

#: files/parchaos-welcome:191
msgid "Updates"
msgstr ""

#: files/parchaos-welcome:191
msgid ""
"ParchaOS tells you when updates are ready. Installing them from Parcha Store "
"restarts the computer a few times. That is normal, so let it finish. You can "
"also run sudo dnf upgrade in a terminal."
msgstr ""

